      "title": "Embedded song demo \u00b7 usage",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Embed a YuE2-Kit FLAC's settings in this workflow, here to add a visualizer video afterwards.\n\n1. Choose or upload the **FLAC**. The node stores the prompt, workflow and score it embeds, so the video's embedded workflow carries them too.\n2. Pick a **still image**, then run.\n\nThe FLAC needs an embedded score, which Final outputs \u00b7 ABC + FLAC writes. The example group shows the stored score; title and artist come from the song's FLAC player info settings."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Embed a YuE2-Kit FLAC's settings in this workflow, here to add a visualizer video afterwards.\n\n1. Choose or upload the **FLAC**. The node stores the prompt, workflow and score it embeds, so the video's embedded workflow carries them too.\n2. Pick a **still image**, then run.\n\nThe FLAC needs an embedded score, which Final outputs \u00b7 ABC + FLAC writes. The example group shows the stored score; title and artist come from the song's FLAC player info settings."
      },
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
